  "label": "Service Industry Gender Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the stereotype that women are disproportionately represented in service industries (like coffee shops) and are expected to embody specific traits — such as cheerfulness, friendliness, and emotional availability — that are not expected of men in the same roles. This stereotype is part of broader gendered assumptions about labor and emotional expression.",
